  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jaba Sene Ton Onion Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Onion/Shallot.Beneficiaries: 480 (400 women).Description: The group seeks to obtain training and assistance on credit search and management including audit and recruit a manager to increase their ability to make links with financial institutions to increase the capacity of the coop to pay members&apos; onions and sell them through the counter, organize the onion marketing campaign, and increase coop and members&apos; revenues.</narrative>
